WEBVTT

00:02:59.842 --> 00:03:01.219
And I'm very happy

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.346
to be serving a woman

00:03:04.222 --> 00:03:07.266
who so completely serves her country

00:03:07.308 --> 00:03:08.684
and her people.

00:03:18.152 --> 00:03:22.949
ZG: After we pass these deserts,
we’ll feel safer.

00:03:27.328 --> 00:03:30.873
Slow down. Drive slowly.